<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.885.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.885.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.5 trillion yen of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Thursday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.885  Stop rate     0.451 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.885  Average yield 0.450 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	 5.9361  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids    1.4996  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 36.2912 pct Issue date	 May 20, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity	   August 20, 1997</p>
</text>
